WEBVTT

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:04.783
I want to let them speak for themselves,
beginning with Ximena Loría.

00:01:05.783 --> 00:01:08.286
Ximena is working in Central America

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.796
to influence public policy
and develop young leaders.

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:15.586
She has given presentations on climate
to thousands of people

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.308
and has now created her own NGO.

00:01:19.102 --> 00:01:20.972
Ximena Loría: My name is Ximena Loría.

00:01:20.996 --> 00:01:22.152
I'm from Costa Rica,

00:01:22.176 --> 00:01:26.347
and I attended the 2016 training
in Houston, Texas.

00:01:26.371 --> 00:01:29.706
After the training,
my life changed completely.

00:01:29.730 --> 00:01:32.696
I founded an NGO called Misión 2 Grados.